ezy-view (0.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Trading safety: closing or reducing a position no longer requires free
    margin, a rejected close is reported in the UI, and MetaTrader 5 stop/target
    amends target the position ticket without clearing the other level.
  * Debian policy compliance: maintainer contact, libc6 dependency, changelog,
    copyright, man page and AppStream metadata are now shipped.
  * Tag-triggered release workflow with lintian, package-content,
    desktop-file-validate, AppStream and install/launch smoke gates.
  * Version consistency is checked across all four version declarations.

 -- printezy247 <printezy247@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

ezy-view (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package EzyView 0.3.0 with Debian metadata, documentation and the
    third-party licence notices required by the bundled chart library.

